      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RIO RAGNAR (1) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (25.91) at Q Lakeside in a Grade 6. Lines up from box 1 for the first time. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Well-placed to take this out. PARTY DON'T STOP (2) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.3 lengths at this track in a handy 28.86 beating Blendon. Has never been out of the placings from three starts out of this box. Can make it two on the bounce. COTTON BALL BUZZ (4) was out of the placings last time when seventh at this track (22.51) but did record best time of the card when winning five back. Worth another chance. TAU CETI (6) has not raced over this journey but still warrants respect.",
